00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.890
so this leg was turned in like this.

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.290
I just, how natural that is.

00:02:53.124 --> 00:02:54.130
- [Mark] Right.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:56.730
