00:02:58.826 --> 00:03:00.635
I mean, I grew up in
Brooklyn Home For Girls.

00:03:00.635 --> 00:03:03.390
There was at, every time,
minimum 100 girls in there,

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.150
