00:03:15.655 --> 00:03:16.659
- [Mark] Really?

00:03:16.659 --> 00:03:18.645
- Absolutely, and this was in the 80s.

00:03:18.645 --> 00:03:20.230
I mean, I'm gonna be 38.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.973
So this was, it was pretty morbid.

00:03:23.144 --> 00:03:25.019
So now mind you, I'm a little white kid

00:03:25.019 --> 00:03:26.278
