00:03:27.111 --> 00:03:29.220
Nuns hate Jews, we killed Jesus right?

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:32.330
So not only that, is
that I'm crippled too.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:34.214
And I mean, I was very crippled.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:35.440
I mean, leg braces, thick
Coke bottle glasses.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.673
Little homely, I was the ugliest kid

