- Ugliest kid in the world.

00:03:42.196 --> 00:03:44.221
I was pale, pale, pale
white, frizzy, curly hair.

00:03:44.221 --> 00:03:45.454
I was a fucking hot mess.

00:03:45.454 --> 00:03:48.413
So (laughing), now, but mind
you, I was there since birth.

00:03:49.252 --> 00:03:50.330
